# Writing kept off the site AND out of the repository.
#
# `draft: true` hides a piece from the built site, but this repository is
# public — a drafted piece is still readable by anyone who opens it. An
# underscore-prefixed file is ignored by the writing collection's glob and by
# this rule, so it never leaves the machine it was written on.
src/content/writing/_*.md
